Battle weather carried over the wide view: rain, hail, the sand crescents.

The field's rain, snow and sand are marked for the compositor
(CtrVideo_MarkWeatherOam), which repeats them over the whole 400x240 view;
the battle's weather sprites were not, and fell over a GBA-sized part of the
screen only - plain to see at BATTLE SCALE 1X. Marked by the template's
address, as the fog is: the rain drops (AnimTask_CreateRaindrops), the hail
(AnimTask_Hail) and the crescents Sandstorm and Heat Wave blow across.

diff --git a/src/sprite.c b/src/sprite.c
--- a/src/sprite.c
